@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFF7DB
hide empty description
title Figure 20. AcademicEquivalence lifecycle (Mihai)
[*] --> PROPOSED
PROPOSED --> UNDER_EVALUATION : evaluationStarted [evaluatorAuthorized]\n/ beginEvaluation(actorId)
UNDER_EVALUATION --> ACTIVE : publicationRequested\n[score >= 80 && equalCredits && validPeriod\n&& noOverlappingRule && rationaleProvided]\n/ approveAndPublish(score, rationale, actorId)
UNDER_EVALUATION : validationFailed / retain the current state
UNDER_EVALUATION --> REJECTED : rejectionConfirmed [reasonProvided]\n/ reject(actorId, reason)
ACTIVE --> RETIRED : retirementRequested [reasonProvided]\n/ retire(actorId, reason)
ACTIVE --> RETIRED : at(startOfDayAfterValidityEnd)\n/ retire(systemActorId, "Validity expired")
REJECTED --> [*]
RETIRED --> [*]
legend bottom
 UC02 starts in UNDER_EVALUATION and succeeds in ACTIVE.
 Approval and publication form one operation; no intermediate APPROVED state.
 isEligible(period) also checks the entire requested mobility period.
 Expiration uses the agreed calendar. An expired rule is ineligible even
 before the retirement job runs. Retiring it does not rewrite confirmed agreements.
endlegend
@enduml
